metapolicy_extra_info:
Russian citizens must have an original Russian passport upon arrival.
Front desk opening hours 09:00 - 22:00.
To confirm guests' reservation, guests must make a deposit within 12 hours by clicking on the link provided by the administrator. Contact details can be found on the booking confirmation. The deposit made by the guest to the card will be refunded at check-out, if the apartment has not been damaged.
Paid services are provided:
1 bathrobe — RUB 500.00;
1 set of slippers — RUB 300.00;
1 set of dental kit — RUB 100.00;
1 baby cot — RUB 1500.00 for the entire stay.
An assortment of coffee capsules is also available for an additional fee. Please check the price with the property's employees.
The price includes accommodation for two guests in one shared bed. Two guests can be accommodated in separate beds for an additional fee of RUB 500.00 per stay.

